WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:28.530
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:28.800 --> 00:32.300
"My Rival and Me" (Episode 3)

3
00:51.800 --> 00:53.080
Now you know what to learn

4
00:53.560 --> 00:54.560
and what not to, right?

5
00:55.080 --> 00:55.640
Stay there.

6
00:55.760 --> 00:56.520
Don't steal my cigarette.

7
00:56.560 --> 00:57.680
I'll expose you online!

8
00:59.960 --> 01:01.360
Sure. I'll help.

9
01:13.320 --> 01:14.400
Wow! This ship is too good!

10
01:17.160 --> 01:18.520
That phone wallpaper

11
01:18.920 --> 01:20.200
was your cat from before, right?

12
01:20.480 --> 01:21.480
So cute.

13
01:23.320 --> 01:24.800
Crap. I only just started following him.

14
01:24.800 --> 01:26.600
I shouldn't know that ancient video.

15
01:26.600 --> 01:29.440
Now I really look obsessed with his body and soul!

16
01:30.600 --> 01:31.800
So you saw it.

17
01:33.440 --> 01:35.040
Were you more careful

18
01:35.640 --> 01:36.720
while filming after that?

19
01:39.320 --> 01:40.320
What do you mean?

20
01:42.960 --> 01:44.520
I thought you knew.

21
01:45.360 --> 01:46.920
Knew what, man?

22
01:46.920 --> 01:48.360
Can you please be clear?

23
01:48.360 --> 01:49.840
You're giving me a heart attack.

24
01:51.480 --> 01:52.200
It's nothing.

25
01:52.320 --> 01:54.280
You sprained your ankle before

26
01:54.600 --> 01:55.800
and posted about it, right?

27
01:56.040 --> 01:58.320
I saw one of my big fan accounts repost it,

28
01:58.600 --> 01:59.696
claiming your injury was fake.

29
01:59.720 --> 02:00.960
I was angry.

30
02:01.480 --> 02:02.520
I thought it went too far.

31
02:03.120 --> 02:05.080
My manager wouldn't let me speak up directly.

32
02:05.760 --> 02:07.080
I didn't know you well then,

33
02:07.680 --> 02:08.920
so I made a video.

34
02:09.840 --> 02:10.960
When I posted it,

35
02:11.320 --> 02:12.760
I didn't think you'd see it.

36
02:13.760 --> 02:15.280
And even if you did,

37
02:15.840 --> 02:17.280
you wouldn't know what it meant.

38
02:18.400 --> 02:20.080
Gu Yiliang posted on Weibo,

39
02:20.080 --> 02:21.920
clearly responding to our Wei Yanzi.

40
02:21.920 --> 02:23.880
A subtle display of love!

41
02:27.080 --> 02:28.080
What's wrong?

42
02:30.000 --> 02:31.280
Nothing.

43
02:31.960 --> 02:33.640
I've just had too much sweetness.

44
02:34.960 --> 02:36.240
I'm about to get diabetes.

45
02:39.480 --> 02:40.480
What did you say?

46
02:43.600 --> 02:44.600
I didn't catch that.

47
02:48.240 --> 02:51.840
This isn't my heart fluttering.

48
02:51.840 --> 02:55.600
It's my heart dropping a sick beat!

49
03:06.040 --> 03:07.640
Be gentle!

50
03:07.880 --> 03:09.240
I make my living with this face.

51
03:10.040 --> 03:11.200
So you do remember.

52
03:11.600 --> 03:13.240
I thought you'd become a stunt double.

53
03:13.760 --> 03:15.400
It's not like I haven't done that before.

54
03:35.840 --> 03:36.840
Enough.

55
03:36.960 --> 03:38.080
I'm going home.

56
03:40.480 --> 03:41.680
Now it's your turn to help me.

57
03:43.680 --> 03:44.680
Cheng Yan,

58
03:44.720 --> 03:46.440
can you stop trying to do it everywhere?

59
03:46.520 --> 03:47.760
I'm injured!

60
03:48.280 --> 03:49.560
It's your face that's injured.

61
03:50.120 --> 03:51.120
He kicked your ass too?

62
03:51.160 --> 03:51.520
You...

63
03:51.960 --> 03:52.320
Hey!

64
03:52.760 --> 03:53.040
Hey!

65
03:53.120 --> 03:55.280
Cheng Yan, have you no humanity? What are you doing?

66
03:55.440 --> 03:56.000
I want...

67
03:56.240 --> 03:57.680
Why are you in such a hurry?

68
03:58.000 --> 03:59.440
What's the rush?

69
03:59.880 --> 04:01.680
I need to get back and drink some tea.

70
04:01.880 --> 04:03.120
Time to restore my health.

71
04:04.040 --> 04:05.120
You like tea too?

72
04:05.240 --> 04:05.840
Huh?

73
04:05.920 --> 04:06.920
White tea,

74
04:07.400 --> 04:08.400
green tea,

75
04:08.640 --> 04:09.640
Longjing?

76
04:10.720 --> 04:11.720
What's your favorite?

77
04:12.080 --> 04:12.840
I'll get you a box.

78
04:12.960 --> 04:13.960
No, that's okay.

79
04:14.000 --> 04:15.000
Gu Yiliang!

80
04:17.960 --> 04:22.120
My ship was sailing, and now he's revealed a girlfriend!

81
04:24.520 --> 04:25.520
This is my mom.

82
04:26.000 --> 04:27.000
Hello, Mom.

83
04:28.640 --> 04:30.840
I need to flee the scene.

84
04:32.960 --> 04:35.640
Didn't you need to get back for tea?

85
04:38.040 --> 04:40.000
Thanks. Yes, it's getting cold.

86
04:40.080 --> 04:41.480
I'll leave you two to talk.

87
04:45.760 --> 04:47.080
You don't answer my messages.

88
04:47.520 --> 04:49.000
I have to come yell at you in person.

89
04:49.480 --> 04:51.120
How could someone be so low.

90
04:53.200 --> 04:55.080
Didn't I just give you 300,000 yuan?

91
04:55.720 --> 04:57.160
How is 300,000 enough?

92
04:57.320 --> 04:58.720
You think I'm a beggar?

93
04:59.040 --> 05:00.960
At least 30 million!

94
05:03.680 --> 05:04.680
I don't have it.

95
05:05.200 --> 05:07.320
Then find someone to keep you!

96
05:07.800 --> 05:10.400
Your dad and I raised you all these years.

97
05:10.560 --> 05:12.320
What's wrong with contributing to the family?

98
05:12.880 --> 05:15.160
Don't forget you owe your brother too.

99
05:16.000 --> 05:17.360
If you refuse,

100
05:17.720 --> 05:19.240
I'll expose all the filthy things

101
05:19.400 --> 05:20.400
you've done.

102
05:20.480 --> 05:22.720
I'll ruin your precious celebrity career.

103
05:23.120 --> 05:24.120
Ma'am,

104
05:25.480 --> 05:27.000
that's way out of line.

105
05:29.160 --> 05:30.160
Who are you?

106
05:30.560 --> 05:31.720
I'm his mother.

107
05:33.600 --> 05:34.600
Stepmother.

108
05:35.960 --> 05:37.080
Stepmother?

109
05:37.480 --> 05:39.000
That explains it.

110
05:40.240 --> 05:41.280
Stepmothers in dramas

111
05:41.280 --> 05:42.960
are never any good.

112
05:43.320 --> 05:44.760
What did you say?

113
05:44.840 --> 05:46.720
You keep going on about casting couches.

114
05:47.080 --> 05:48.000
We live under the rule of law.

115
05:48.040 --> 05:49.920
You're inciting crime, you know?

116
05:50.080 --> 05:51.760
Crime?

117
05:52.520 --> 05:54.200
What Gu Yiliang did

118
05:54.480 --> 05:56.800
deserves worse than a criminal sentence.

119
05:56.840 --> 05:57.840
What did he do?

120
05:57.920 --> 05:58.800
Fake his degree?

121
05:58.920 --> 06:00.360
Get roles through shady connections?

122
06:00.720 --> 06:01.880
Take drugs?

123
06:01.920 --> 06:04.680
Those rumors were debunked ages ago.

124
06:05.520 --> 06:07.160
Especially the drug allegations.

125
06:07.400 --> 06:08.520
To fit a role,

126
06:08.560 --> 06:09.680
he lost ten kilos.

127
06:09.760 --> 06:11.280
He was forced to a hospital in the dead of night

128
06:11.280 --> 06:12.616
for a drug test to prove his innocence.

129
06:12.640 --> 06:15.200
His agency and the crew spoke up for him.

130
06:15.320 --> 06:16.760
Even the authorities announced

131
06:16.840 --> 06:18.040
that he'd done nothing wrong.

132
06:18.640 --> 06:19.440
And still,

133
06:19.520 --> 06:20.800
people slander him.

134
06:21.040 --> 06:22.040
Why?

135
06:22.240 --> 06:23.560
Why treat him like that?

136
06:27.520 --> 06:28.360
Are you his manager?

137
06:28.360 --> 06:29.360
I'm his partner.

138
06:31.480 --> 06:32.480
Partner?

139
06:32.600 --> 06:34.480
His... his rival!

140
06:35.600 --> 06:36.200
Lady,

141
06:36.480 --> 06:38.560
is old age affecting your hearing?

142
06:38.640 --> 06:39.680
You little...

143
06:41.960 --> 06:43.200
Go back and tell your husband

144
06:43.920 --> 06:46.520
Gu Yiliang will give him 100,000 yuan a month.

145
06:46.960 --> 06:48.600
If I hear you slandering him again,

146
06:49.080 --> 06:53.040
I'll spend your precious 30 million on his PR.

147
06:53.360 --> 06:55.440
I'll make sure the whole world knows

148
06:55.760 --> 06:57.600
how you've been bleeding him dry.

149
06:58.440 --> 07:01.320
I'll hire the best lawyer to fight you.

150
07:01.640 --> 07:04.200
I promise you won't get a penny.

151
07:07.520 --> 07:08.520
Only 100,000?

152
07:08.720 --> 07:09.560
Who are you to...

153
07:09.600 --> 07:12.280
Shh.

154
07:12.520 --> 07:13.960
Keep talking, and I'll get annoyed.

155
07:16.880 --> 07:17.960
Woman,

156
07:18.920 --> 07:21.400
you've successfully made me uncomfortable.

157
07:21.840 --> 07:23.880
Don't test my limits.

158
07:24.880 --> 07:26.720
You can't afford the consequences.

159
07:27.960 --> 07:29.160
Let me tell you,

160
07:30.160 --> 07:32.000
anyone who touches my Gu Yiliang

161
07:32.920 --> 07:35.360
will see their whole world destroyed.

162
07:37.840 --> 07:38.920
The weather's turning cold.

163
07:40.280 --> 07:41.880
Time for the Gu Group to go bankrupt.

164
07:45.760 --> 07:46.760
Let's go.

165
07:50.920 --> 07:52.800
Hey, you two!

166
08:13.080 --> 08:14.080
Don't worry.

167
08:14.200 --> 08:15.200
It's all right.

168
08:16.880 --> 08:17.360
Yeah.

169
08:17.760 --> 08:18.760
Don't worry.

170
08:19.120 --> 08:20.120
It's all sorted out.

171
08:22.000 --> 08:23.000
That's good.

172
08:23.960 --> 08:24.960
About just now,

173
08:25.520 --> 08:26.080
thank you.

174
08:26.240 --> 08:27.680
It's nothing.

175
08:30.560 --> 08:31.560
Then,

176
08:31.680 --> 08:32.920
how about a smile?

177
08:34.560 --> 08:35.560
Come on.

178
08:36.640 --> 08:38.240
What am I doing?

179
08:38.240 --> 08:40.280
Acting out fanfiction?

180
08:46.920 --> 08:49.600
My domineering CEO act was pretty good, right?

181
08:51.320 --> 08:52.480
Better than mine.

182
08:52.800 --> 08:54.920
Just a little party trick.

183
08:56.000 --> 08:57.200
So, my rival,

184
08:59.280 --> 09:00.880
why do you remember so much about me

185
09:01.200 --> 09:02.240
and defend me like that?

186
09:02.440 --> 09:03.960
I remember everything about you.

187
09:07.600 --> 09:08.040
No!

188
09:08.160 --> 09:09.760
I... I mean,

189
09:09.760 --> 09:11.000
I didn't remember it before,

190
09:11.000 --> 09:12.480
but just now, suddenly,

191
09:12.480 --> 09:14.000
it all came back.

192
09:17.880 --> 09:18.880
No.

193
09:19.080 --> 09:20.080
I mean,

194
09:20.600 --> 09:22.160
I only remember a little.

195
09:24.080 --> 09:25.440
I'm done. Let the world burn.

196
09:25.440 --> 09:27.160
Or let me move to another planet.

197
09:27.560 --> 09:28.560
Is being my fan

198
09:28.800 --> 09:30.000
something to be ashamed of?

199
09:35.400 --> 09:36.400
Yes, Mr. Gu.

200
09:36.400 --> 09:38.320
I really am your fan.

201
09:39.720 --> 09:40.720
Then,

202
09:41.480 --> 09:42.160
Mr. Gu,

203
09:42.240 --> 09:43.680
could I have your autograph?

204
10:03.520 --> 10:04.680
Thank you, Mr. Gu.

205
10:08.400 --> 10:09.680
Give me yours too.

206
10:23.040 --> 10:26.920
I should still warn him to prepare some crisis PR.

207
10:26.920 --> 10:29.040
But why does seeing him bullied

208
10:29.040 --> 10:31.240
make my heart hurt so much?

209
10:34.360 --> 10:35.360
A creature this beautiful

210
10:35.600 --> 10:36.960
could wreak havoc on the world.

211
10:37.280 --> 10:38.520
I should claim him.

212
10:38.640 --> 10:39.600
It really is good.

213
10:39.640 --> 10:40.040
Right?

214
10:40.040 --> 10:40.400
Yeah.

215
10:40.560 --> 10:42.040
Anyone who touches my Gu Yiliang

216
10:42.120 --> 10:44.200
will see their whole world destroyed.

217
10:44.320 --> 10:45.320
Let's go.

218
10:46.920 --> 10:47.920
So, my rival,

219
10:48.200 --> 10:49.640
why do you remember so much about me

220
10:50.200 --> 10:51.240
and defend me like that?

221
10:57.360 --> 10:58.760
I want to ask you the same thing.

222
10:59.200 --> 11:00.680
Why am I so protective of you,

223
11:01.320 --> 11:02.320
my rival?

224
11:11.200 --> 11:12.400
Why ask so many questions?

225
11:12.560 --> 11:13.560
Shippers are fans too.

226
11:14.120 --> 11:14.760
From now on,

227
11:15.000 --> 11:16.360
I'm Gu Yiliang's dad fan.

228
11:17.200 --> 11:18.280
He's such a good person.

229
11:18.680 --> 11:20.840
Who wouldn't want to be his overprotective dad?

230
11:22.560 --> 11:23.560
A dad fan.

231
11:24.880 --> 11:26.120
Get some herbal tea.

232
11:37.600 --> 11:38.600
Right.

233
11:39.200 --> 11:40.200
Just a fan.

234
11:40.800 --> 11:41.800
Stop overthinking.

235
11:46.213 --> 11:47.699
[Gu Yiliang posted on Weibo]

236
11:50.400 --> 11:51.320
Your eyes,

237
11:51.320 --> 11:52.280
your smile,

238
11:52.280 --> 11:53.480
bright as the stars,

239
11:53.480 --> 11:54.560
gentle as the night breeze,

240
11:54.560 --> 11:56.680
are the loveliest sights I've ever seen.

241
12:27.240 --> 12:29.440
Douya, what's my heart rate?

242
12:29.440 --> 12:32.080
182 beats per minute. Too high.

243
12:32.080 --> 12:34.840
Please slow down and cycle gently.

244
12:37.600 --> 12:39.320
Help me record a diary entry.

245
12:40.000 --> 12:41.520
My rival stood up for me yesterday.

246
12:43.880 --> 12:46.240
Watching him leave Wang Huanxu speechless,

247
12:47.440 --> 12:49.080
I felt bubbles in my chest,

248
12:49.440 --> 12:52.000
rising and bursting, one after another.

249
12:54.080 --> 12:56.720
I've realized that no matter how bad I feel,

250
12:57.120 --> 12:58.560
as long as he's there,

251
12:59.600 --> 13:01.000
he can pull me back.

252
13:01.840 --> 13:02.920
Oh, and

253
13:04.360 --> 13:06.960
he can't convincingly play anything,

254
13:07.760 --> 13:11.640
except a domineering CEO.

255
13:13.960 --> 13:15.320
Isn't that adorable?

256
13:15.600 --> 13:19.880
Recorded. That's your tenth "cute," by the way.

257
13:19.920 --> 13:20.920
I...

258
13:22.360 --> 13:24.200
Incoming call from Cheng Yan. High priority.

259
13:29.800 --> 13:30.800
Hello, Mr. Cheng.

260
13:31.000 --> 13:32.160
It's taken care of.

261
13:32.360 --> 13:33.400
Oh, thank you.

262
13:33.480 --> 13:34.840
You're one of our artists.

263
13:35.680 --> 13:37.120
It's our job to protect you.

264
13:37.840 --> 13:38.680
By the way,

265
13:38.840 --> 13:40.560
there's a livestream partnership tonight.

266
13:41.080 --> 13:43.720
You and Wei Yanzi.

267
13:44.520 --> 13:46.480
What partnership is so important

268
13:46.600 --> 13:47.960
that you have to tell me yourself?

269
13:48.080 --> 13:52.000
Your Weibo interactions have been getting attention.

270
13:52.520 --> 13:53.840
Wang Man suggested

271
13:54.000 --> 13:56.320
you use this chance to do some fanservice.

272
13:56.560 --> 13:57.880
But she thought you might refuse.

273
13:57.920 --> 13:59.480
I'm sounding you out.

274
14:00.840 --> 14:02.080
Wouldn't that be bad?

275
14:03.200 --> 14:05.560
It's true, you don't stand to gain much.

276
14:06.160 --> 14:08.000
I meant bad for Wei Yanzi.

277
14:08.840 --> 14:10.920
His haters are pretty vicious.

278
14:12.240 --> 14:13.480
I'm afraid he'll get more hate.

279
14:14.040 --> 14:15.360
The old tree is blooming at last.

280
14:16.640 --> 14:17.640
What?

281
14:19.160 --> 14:20.280
Apparently not.

282
14:20.720 --> 14:22.640
Wei Yanzi has lots of haters,

283
14:23.000 --> 14:24.040
but devoted fans too.

284
14:24.680 --> 14:27.440
Some fanservice could broaden his fanbase.

285
14:27.520 --> 14:28.520
Suit yourself.

286
14:35.160 --> 14:37.240
What's your favorite line?

287
14:40.800 --> 14:42.560
Who are you pairing up? I'll do it.

288
14:44.000 --> 14:45.000
You?

289
14:45.040 --> 14:45.800
Yeah.

290
14:45.880 --> 14:46.920
Before "Lan Jue" airs,

291
14:47.040 --> 14:48.376
I can attract fans with some fanservice

292
14:48.400 --> 14:49.880
and build hype for my role.

293
14:50.240 --> 14:51.240
Who's his partner?

294
14:51.480 --> 14:52.040
Doesn't matter.

295
14:52.320 --> 14:53.320
Anyone will do.

296
14:53.760 --> 14:54.480
You're willing,

297
14:54.720 --> 14:56.240
but the other person has to agree too.

298
14:57.240 --> 14:58.280
What's there to agree to?

299
14:59.240 --> 15:00.720
Isn't it all about business?

300
15:02.280 --> 15:02.840
Wait.

301
15:03.200 --> 15:04.320
Aren't you my sugar daddy?

302
15:04.960 --> 15:08.413
I'm just asking if I can pick up fanservice jobs others reject.

303
15:08.840 --> 15:10.000
Why are you so tense?

304
15:11.120 --> 15:12.320
You hadn't even filmed a scene

305
15:12.920 --> 15:14.040
before you got into a fight.

306
15:14.840 --> 15:17.480
I had to spend time and effort fixing it.

307
15:18.720 --> 15:20.400
I should be the one weighing the benefits.

308
15:21.800 --> 15:22.800
Being your sugar daddy

309
15:22.960 --> 15:24.080
is terrible value for money.

310
15:45.440 --> 15:47.200
I'll do fanservice with Wei Yanzi.

311
15:57.840 --> 15:58.920
Xiao Chen,

312
15:59.320 --> 16:00.760
what's wrong with Mr. Wei?

313
16:01.400 --> 16:02.400
I don't know.

314
16:02.600 --> 16:03.880
He's been like that all morning.

315
16:04.440 --> 16:07.040
Like he fell madly in love last night,

316
16:07.640 --> 16:08.640
then got dumped,

317
16:09.120 --> 16:10.120
then got back together,

318
16:10.800 --> 16:11.800
dumped again,

319
16:12.080 --> 16:13.080
then got back together.

320
16:13.440 --> 16:14.040
Impossible.

321
16:14.440 --> 16:15.480
Who would dump Mr. Wei?

322
16:16.440 --> 16:18.640
Unless they were as famous as Mr. Gu.

323
16:19.200 --> 16:20.560
Why not?

324
16:20.560 --> 16:22.200
It's him! It's definitely him!

325
16:33.440 --> 16:34.440
Wei Yanzi,

326
16:34.480 --> 16:35.600
confess your crimes.

327
16:36.240 --> 16:38.640
You and Gu Yiliang toyed with your fans' feelings.

328
16:38.760 --> 16:40.400
You flaunted an autographed phone case,

329
16:40.480 --> 16:42.720
making everyone think this time was different.

330
16:43.080 --> 16:45.080
Now you're saying it was all fake

331
16:45.160 --> 16:46.560
and declaring you're just bros?

332
16:46.640 --> 16:47.760
Your Honor,

333
16:47.920 --> 16:49.840
I wasn't deliberately doing fanservice.

334
16:49.920 --> 16:51.480
Gu Yiliang is straight.

335
16:51.480 --> 16:53.520
He doesn't realize what he's doing.

336
16:53.760 --> 16:55.320
He didn't know any better.

337
16:55.520 --> 16:56.640
But you?

338
16:56.880 --> 16:57.680
You never initiate,

339
16:57.840 --> 16:58.640
never refuse,

340
16:58.760 --> 16:59.600
and never take responsibility.

341
16:59.720 --> 17:02.160
You secretly feast on the shippers' sweetness

342
17:02.440 --> 17:03.840
and devour their fanworks,

343
17:03.960 --> 17:06.160
then think you can vanish without a trace?

344
17:06.320 --> 17:08.360
Your Honor, that's not...

345
17:08.360 --> 17:09.360
Fraud!

346
17:10.000 --> 17:11.400
This is fraud!

347
17:12.560 --> 17:13.760
Straight guys selling a ship,

348
17:14.120 --> 17:15.240
just to cash in!

349
17:16.120 --> 17:17.120
Your Honor,

350
17:17.240 --> 17:19.480
I was wrong. I repent.

351
17:19.720 --> 17:20.920
Since you've confessed,

352
17:21.080 --> 17:22.800
I sentence you to life in prison.

353
17:23.440 --> 17:26.000
Lock him and Gu Yiliang

354
17:26.160 --> 17:28.560
in the room they can't leave without doing XX!

355
17:30.720 --> 17:35.000
I'm guilty, Your Honor! Lock me up!

356
17:35.280 --> 17:37.520
Never let me out!

357
17:37.600 --> 17:39.800
Your Honor, I'm guilty!

358
17:40.640 --> 17:41.440
Yanzi,

359
17:41.640 --> 17:44.240
Man says we've booked a livestream event

360
17:44.480 --> 17:45.800
to promote the new show

361
17:45.960 --> 17:46.960
and sell a little

362
17:47.160 --> 17:48.200
bromance.

363
17:48.440 --> 17:49.120
How do we sell it?

364
17:49.240 --> 17:50.240
By the pound?

365
17:57.800 --> 17:59.360
Perfect timing.

366
17:59.520 --> 18:00.400
Sell it.

367
18:00.400 --> 18:02.040
Sell it right now.

368
18:05.280 --> 18:08.080
Is it happening? Is the Niangzi master making his move?

369
18:08.080 --> 18:10.040
This publicity plan is brilliant.

370
18:10.040 --> 18:13.360
Everyone will think Gu's flirting was under company orders,

371
18:13.360 --> 18:15.280
and I can enjoy my ship without guilt!

372
18:15.280 --> 18:16.800
A flawless plan.

373
18:18.360 --> 18:19.360
We're live.

374
18:19.400 --> 18:21.360
Hello, everyone. I'm Gu Yiliang.

375
18:21.520 --> 18:24.000
It's great to meet you through this livestream.

376
18:25.400 --> 18:28.320
This is my good buddy, my bro, Wei Yanzi.

377
18:30.720 --> 18:31.360
Are you okay?

378
18:31.440 --> 18:32.440
I'm fine.

379
18:32.840 --> 18:34.600
Hello, everyone. I'm Wei Yanzi.

380
18:34.800 --> 18:36.640
I'm fine.

381
18:36.760 --> 18:37.760
Are you sure?

382
18:38.400 --> 18:39.560
Wei hasn't eaten yet.

383
18:39.960 --> 18:41.200
Let him eat something first.

384
18:41.480 --> 18:42.960
I'll chat with you all.

385
18:43.720 --> 18:45.680
Bye, Wei.

386
18:45.680 --> 18:49.640
The epic livestream sweetness I'd imagined fans replaying...

387
18:51.280 --> 18:53.440
Gu's fussing over him. Wei Yanzi's so girly!

388
18:55.760 --> 18:57.680
A contest to see who's straighter?

389
18:57.680 --> 19:00.200
I'm a genuine straight guy. How could I lose?

390
19:00.440 --> 19:01.040
Delicious.

391
19:01.360 --> 19:02.360
Delicious.

392
19:09.200 --> 19:10.400
I'm full. Thanks, bro.

393
19:10.560 --> 19:11.560
Here.

394
19:11.800 --> 19:13.000
Let's answer some comments.

395
19:13.920 --> 19:15.096
Streaming even with a bad cold?

396
19:15.120 --> 19:16.456
Drink plenty of hot water for a cold.

397
19:16.480 --> 19:17.800
Open the window and get some air.

398
19:17.840 --> 19:19.680
What music have you two been listening to?

399
19:19.800 --> 19:20.920
Mr. Yan's songs.

400
19:21.120 --> 19:21.920
Soothing to the soul.

401
19:22.000 --> 19:23.120
Mr. Jiang's songs.

402
19:23.280 --> 19:24.600
Explosively loud.

403
19:24.680 --> 19:25.920
What games do you play?

404
19:25.920 --> 19:27.440
We'd love to see you team up.

405
19:27.800 --> 19:28.840
5,000 MMR in Dota.

406
19:28.920 --> 19:29.680
Ask him about teaming up.

407
19:29.760 --> 19:30.760
Master tier in League.

408
19:30.880 --> 19:32.160
All challengers welcome.

409
19:35.360 --> 19:36.360
Yanzi.

410
19:37.960 --> 19:38.640
Yanzi.

411
19:38.880 --> 19:39.680
Sorry, everyone.

412
19:39.800 --> 19:40.840
My assistant needs me.

413
19:41.080 --> 19:42.400
Chat with Mr. Gu for a bit.

414
19:42.600 --> 19:43.760
I'll be right back.

415
19:47.360 --> 19:49.016
You're selling that bromance so professionally,

416
19:49.040 --> 19:51.440
I asked the publicity team for two of these.

417
19:51.720 --> 19:52.720
Here.

418
19:55.240 --> 19:56.240
Peaches?

419
19:57.920 --> 19:58.760
What's that supposed to mean?

420
19:58.800 --> 20:00.200
In case you get carried away

421
20:00.240 --> 20:01.416
and decide to swear brotherhood,

422
20:01.440 --> 20:03.000
I brought you some props.

423
20:04.520 --> 20:05.800
I feel like you and Gu Yiliang

424
20:05.840 --> 20:07.920
are both out to kill me.

425
20:08.240 --> 20:10.000
I'm under attack from both sides.

426
20:10.240 --> 20:11.720
I'm not that hungry.

427
20:11.720 --> 20:13.320
I'll eat later.

428
20:15.280 --> 20:16.960
Why did you bring back fruit?

429
20:17.320 --> 20:18.320
It's not for eating.

430
20:18.360 --> 20:19.000
What's it for, then?

431
20:19.040 --> 20:20.040
A ritual offering.

432
20:21.800 --> 20:23.480
Yanzi won't let me have a peach.

433
20:24.200 --> 20:25.480
Come on, give me one.

434
20:25.560 --> 20:27.840
If some god gets upset about missing a peach

435
20:28.000 --> 20:29.216
and knocks on the door tonight,

436
20:29.240 --> 20:30.080
I'll answer it.

437
20:30.160 --> 20:31.480
I won't disturb your sleep.

438
20:33.400 --> 20:35.560
What are you doing, Yanzi?

439
20:35.560 --> 20:37.448
Where's my good bro Wei?

440
20:37.473 --> 20:39.873
Switching from straight guy to master shipper just like that?

441
20:40.200 --> 20:42.600
Is filming tiring?

442
20:42.800 --> 20:44.240
A little.

443
20:44.560 --> 20:47.000
But we're usually in bed by one or two.

444
20:47.440 --> 20:49.320
Wait. That sounded ambiguous.

445
20:51.400 --> 20:51.840
Styling?

446
20:51.960 --> 20:53.640
What do we think of our looks?

447
20:53.840 --> 20:56.760
My overall palette is blue-gray.

448
20:56.880 --> 20:58.840
Yes. It goes with my brick red.

449
21:03.880 --> 21:05.320
What are your hobbies?

450
21:05.400 --> 21:06.840
Weightlifting.

451
21:07.240 --> 21:09.320
Every man's favorite sport.

452
21:10.040 --> 21:11.200
You lift weights?

453
21:11.720 --> 21:12.840
Shall I try lifting you?

454
21:13.240 --> 21:15.120
Sure. Don't drop me.

455
21:15.600 --> 21:16.640
Bet you a late-night meal.

456
21:17.360 --> 21:17.960
You're on.

457
21:18.200 --> 21:19.200
Come on.

458
21:19.680 --> 21:20.680
Come on.

459
21:21.480 --> 21:22.440
Fine, I'll lift you.

460
21:22.440 --> 21:24.080
Everyone on the stream is watching.

461
21:24.080 --> 21:25.920
My manly pride is at stake.

462
22:04.960 --> 22:05.960
Cheng Yan.

463
22:09.800 --> 22:10.800
Hmm?

464
22:10.920 --> 22:13.640
I've been nominated for Best Supporting Actor at the Jinlan Awards.

465
22:14.560 --> 22:16.560
There's something I want to tell you.

466
22:17.160 --> 22:17.920
I think

467
22:18.080 --> 22:20.000
we should stop having this kind of relationship.

468
22:20.200 --> 22:20.440
I want

469
22:20.440 --> 22:21.440
What do you want?

470
22:24.000 --> 22:25.480
You think you're about to get famous,

471
22:25.960 --> 22:27.480
so you want a new patron?

472
22:28.560 --> 22:29.560
Is that it?

473
22:36.080 --> 22:37.080
Too bad.

474
22:38.200 --> 22:40.240
Nobody else is as generous as I am,

475
22:41.040 --> 22:43.200
paying more than you're worth.

476
22:57.680 --> 23:00.520
I brought this on myself. Why complain?

477
23:00.520 --> 23:03.400
Put up with it. Think of it as a job.

478
23:18.360 --> 23:19.040
Mr. Cheng,

479
23:19.280 --> 23:21.360
Mr. Zhu still hasn't signed his management contract.

480
23:23.320 --> 23:24.320
I know.

481
23:24.400 --> 23:26.080
He's too lazy to read it. I'll remind him.

482
23:26.240 --> 23:28.680
But I hear he's talking to another production company.

483
23:29.040 --> 23:32.600
Did that nomination make him too good for Hengtu?

484
23:53.720 --> 23:54.880
Are you angry?

485
23:55.040 --> 23:56.120
I'm sorry.

486
23:56.160 --> 23:57.720
Everything before was my fault.

487
24:00.600 --> 24:03.080
This is how you apologize?

488
24:04.960 --> 24:08.360
You said I never took the initiative to help.

489
24:10.800 --> 24:11.800
Get out.

490
24:12.800 --> 24:14.000
What do you mean, Cheng Yan?

491
24:14.000 --> 24:15.120
What's wrong with you?

492
24:16.120 --> 24:17.120
Get out.

493
24:30.920 --> 24:35.440
How can he compete to be the straightest one second,

494
24:41.360 --> 24:46.640
then tumble into my arms with that loving smile the next?

495
24:47.280 --> 24:48.280
Washed and ready.

496
24:48.800 --> 24:49.800
Thanks.

497
24:51.440 --> 24:53.560
Are you upset about the livestream?

498
24:54.640 --> 24:56.360
It was the company's arrangement, after all.

499
24:56.680 --> 24:57.680
No!

500
24:57.840 --> 24:59.280
How could I be angry with you?

501
25:02.400 --> 25:03.400
Wait.

502
25:03.440 --> 25:05.080
You knew they wanted us to do fanservice?

503
25:06.480 --> 25:07.480
Of course.

504
25:16.920 --> 25:19.120
I wasn't going to agree at first.

505
25:19.640 --> 25:20.800
It felt wrong.

506
25:22.320 --> 25:23.760
Then I realized

507
25:23.760 --> 25:25.480
a little extra attention could be good.

508
25:26.120 --> 25:28.120
And maybe

509
25:28.920 --> 25:30.400
it could broaden my range.

510
25:32.480 --> 25:33.520
Then tell me,

511
25:34.120 --> 25:36.040
why do you keep switching between coy and flirty?

512
25:37.120 --> 25:39.160
I wanted to take it slowly,

513
25:40.200 --> 25:41.640
but you weren't playing along.

514
25:43.280 --> 25:44.920
I was just going to call you Yanzi

515
25:45.160 --> 25:46.320
and share a peach.

516
25:46.400 --> 25:47.520
That would've done the job.

517
25:48.440 --> 25:49.600
I wasn't playing along?

518
25:49.920 --> 25:51.320
That was taking it slowly?

519
25:51.880 --> 25:53.440
You nearly scared me to death!

520
25:54.360 --> 25:55.520
What's there to be scared of?

521
25:56.400 --> 25:58.720
Is doing fanservice with me that unpleasant?

522
26:00.160 --> 26:01.160
You don't understand.

523
26:01.480 --> 26:02.480
You're a good actor.

524
26:02.600 --> 26:03.360
You've got real talent.

525
26:03.600 --> 26:04.936
You don't need to worry about that stuff.

526
26:04.960 --> 26:05.800
You and I doing fanservice

527
26:05.840 --> 26:08.320
is a total mismatch in status.

528
26:08.840 --> 26:09.880
If it goes well,

529
26:10.160 --> 26:11.160
you gain nothing.

530
26:11.240 --> 26:13.800
If it goes badly, I get all the abuse.

531
26:14.560 --> 26:16.720
All we do is give them a little spark.

532
26:16.840 --> 26:19.360
The fans imagine the rest.

533
26:20.120 --> 26:22.160
There's nothing wrong with our interactions.

534
26:22.560 --> 26:23.640
Don't overthink it.

535
26:26.600 --> 26:29.000
I guess that's true.

536
26:31.920 --> 26:33.120
Then it's settled.

537
26:35.200 --> 26:36.200
Don't worry.

538
26:36.640 --> 26:37.880
I promised to teach you acting.

539
26:38.360 --> 26:40.160
We'll work on it together.

540
26:41.280 --> 26:42.280
Okay.

541
26:46.160 --> 26:47.320
Just like that,

542
26:47.320 --> 26:49.440
Gu Yiliang and I are fanservice partners.

543
26:49.440 --> 26:50.560
Not bad.

544
26:50.560 --> 26:52.600
Acting lessons and shipping at the same time.

545
27:02.520 --> 27:03.680
I can't eat any more.

546
27:05.240 --> 27:06.320
You know,

547
27:06.800 --> 27:08.360
my eyes are bigger than my stomach.

548
27:08.640 --> 27:09.840
I want to try everything,

549
27:10.200 --> 27:11.440
but I can't finish it.

550
27:12.120 --> 27:14.080
Want to take it to go?

551
27:14.680 --> 27:16.440
It'll get soggy.

552
27:17.640 --> 27:19.640
Bring me along whenever you eat.

553
27:19.840 --> 27:21.480
I'll finish the other half.

554
27:25.200 --> 27:26.200
Okay.

555
27:27.800 --> 27:29.440
So happy to buy me dinner?

556
27:30.160 --> 27:32.200
If I sold you, would you help count the money?

557
27:32.400 --> 27:33.400
You wouldn't.

558
27:34.880 --> 27:35.880
Why not?

559
27:37.000 --> 27:38.600
Couldn't bear to sell me?

560
27:41.160 --> 27:41.960
I'll go pay.

561
27:42.040 --> 27:43.040
Okay.

562
27:47.400 --> 27:48.400
Hello?

563
27:48.720 --> 27:50.800
Mr. Huang!

564
27:51.200 --> 27:53.240
I know.

565
27:54.480 --> 27:55.480
Hello.

566
27:58.680 --> 28:00.200
I'm settling in well.

567
28:00.280 --> 28:01.920
Everything's going smoothly. No problems.

568
28:03.240 --> 28:04.680
I'm not tired.

569
28:04.760 --> 28:06.200
It's just filming a show.

570
28:07.800 --> 28:09.320
I've got enough money.

571
28:09.880 --> 28:11.560
You're not "keeping" some freeloader.

572
28:12.160 --> 28:13.440
I earn my own money too.

573
28:13.880 --> 28:15.840
Please smoke less.

574
28:16.080 --> 28:17.320
Stop making me worry.

575
28:22.840 --> 28:23.560
Girls,

576
28:23.640 --> 28:25.776
Lan Jue announced Wei the dog's playing the second lead.

577
28:25.800 --> 28:28.240
He timed it to leech off Yiliang's stills.

578
28:28.360 --> 28:29.480
Boost our numbers, everyone.

579
28:29.560 --> 28:30.800
Don't let his fans overtake us.

580
28:31.720 --> 28:34.566
Wei the dog's lifeless acting, and he still gets cast?

581
28:34.973 --> 28:38.443
So the rumor about his sugar daddy Huang was true!

582
28:39.233 --> 28:40.993
Disgusting.

583
28:47.640 --> 28:48.920
No way.

584
28:49.840 --> 28:51.720
Just take better care of yourself.

585
28:53.360 --> 28:56.480
Don't come. It won't look good.

586
29:00.120 --> 29:02.360
Have you made any friends?

587
29:07.160 --> 29:08.160
I have.

588
29:08.440 --> 29:09.880
He's really good to me.

589
29:11.640 --> 29:13.480
Don't worry about a thing.

590
29:13.640 --> 29:14.480
Who am I?

591
29:14.520 --> 29:17.440
I'm Huang Qianlong's son!

592
29:28.840 --> 29:29.840
Douya,

593
29:30.440 --> 29:32.706
I think my rival has a sugar daddy.

594
29:32.883 --> 29:36.403
Is that so? Seems you're not the only one who finds him cute.

595
29:36.880 --> 29:37.720
Shut up.

596
29:37.800 --> 29:39.200
He's not that kind of person.

597
29:40.400 --> 29:41.400
Although

598
29:42.120 --> 29:43.520
he really is rather cute.

599
29:44.360 --> 29:45.360
Oh, come on!

600
29:45.440 --> 29:46.800
That's not the point.

601
29:47.320 --> 29:49.760
We just agreed to promote our ship.

602
29:52.440 --> 29:54.120
If it's true,

603
29:55.040 --> 29:56.400
what will happen to him?

604
29:56.400 --> 29:59.680
You should consider yourself first.

605
29:59.680 --> 30:01.960
If his career collapses,

606
30:01.960 --> 30:05.440
you could be dragged down as his "partner."

607
30:05.880 --> 30:07.200
His career...

608
30:08.800 --> 30:09.800
Right.

609
30:11.040 --> 30:12.720
I have to protect his career.

610
30:13.480 --> 30:14.240
Got it.

611
30:14.400 --> 30:15.400
Yeah.

612
30:15.560 --> 30:16.560
Okay.

613
30:19.000 --> 30:20.080
Gu Yiliang.

614
30:20.600 --> 30:21.680
Why are you standing there?

615
30:21.880 --> 30:22.880
Let's go.

616
30:28.240 --> 30:28.720
Yeah.

617
30:29.080 --> 30:30.080
Okay.

618
30:36.920 --> 30:39.120
What's wrong with Gu Yiliang?

619
30:39.280 --> 30:42.120
He just bragged he'd join me for every meal.

620
30:42.280 --> 30:44.280
Now he's ignoring me.

621
30:45.040 --> 30:47.800
One phone call, and he's abandoning me?

622
30:48.320 --> 30:50.600
That jerk is playing with my feelings!

623
30:52.200 --> 30:53.600
Gu Yiliang.

624
30:55.765 --> 31:00.005
No way, did our ship sank before we even launched it?

625
31:00.051 --> 31:01.051
Gu Yiliang,

626
31:01.215 --> 31:05.815
you keep toying with me, over and over again!

627
31:05.839 --> 31:08.319
No. I refuse.

628
31:09.680 --> 31:10.680
Gu Yiliang.

629
31:17.200 --> 31:18.040
Gu Yiliang.

630
31:18.080 --> 31:19.400
Gu Yiliang! Gu...

631
31:20.840 --> 31:21.840
Watch where you're going.

632
31:21.880 --> 31:25.240
That familiar flirting. It's definitely Gu Yiliang.

633
31:25.320 --> 31:27.160
No body-swapping here.

634
31:37.800 --> 31:38.800
When we get back,

635
31:39.040 --> 31:40.400
let's rehearse properly

636
31:42.400 --> 31:43.760
and work on your acting.

637
31:44.880 --> 31:45.560
Oh.

638
31:45.640 --> 31:46.920
Become a real talent,

639
31:49.080 --> 31:50.640
and you'll land more roles.

640
31:52.960 --> 31:54.400
A bright future ahead!

641
31:56.280 --> 31:57.440
I...

642
31:57.680 --> 31:59.200
I'm serious.

643
31:59.760 --> 32:01.040
Stop playing the comic sidekick.

644
32:01.760 --> 32:04.640
Is he unhappy with my acting?

645
32:04.720 --> 32:06.440
Does he think I'm not good enough,

646
32:06.520 --> 32:08.080
so, in the spirit of mutual prosperity,

647
32:08.160 --> 32:11.720
he's training me to be his worthy fanservice partner?

648
32:15.080 --> 32:16.520
You're so good to me.

649
32:19.520 --> 32:20.920
You don't look down on me.

650
32:37.880 --> 32:39.840
Does he look down on me?

651
32:39.946 --> 32:41.506
Or doesn't he?

652
32:47.320 --> 32:48.800
I love you,

653
32:48.880 --> 32:51.240
my darling girl.

654
32:51.520 --> 32:53.000
When I see you,

655
32:53.240 --> 32:55.480
my heart starts racing.

656
32:59.960 --> 33:00.960
How long

657
33:01.920 --> 33:02.680
have you been like this?

658
33:02.880 --> 33:05.880
Bad acting is something you're born with.

659
33:07.640 --> 33:09.560
I've been like this since I started.

660
33:10.800 --> 33:12.280
Aren't you afraid of what people say?

661
33:12.920 --> 33:14.160
Let them talk.

662
33:14.280 --> 33:15.400
I'm used to it.

663
33:18.160 --> 33:19.480
Do many people know?

664
33:20.960 --> 33:22.720
Isn't it obvious to everyone?

665
33:26.400 --> 33:27.560
You know too, don't you?

666
33:29.480 --> 33:30.480
What's wrong?

667
33:31.160 --> 33:32.160
What's wrong?

668
33:33.640 --> 33:34.840
Can't you stop doing this?

669
33:35.320 --> 33:37.960
Does he not want to promote our ship?

670
33:38.040 --> 33:41.760
One minute he does, the next he doesn't. What is this?

671
33:41.840 --> 33:44.080
But for the great Niangzi cause,

672
33:44.120 --> 33:45.400
I can't let you go either.

673
33:47.960 --> 33:48.960
Sure.

674
33:49.200 --> 33:51.440
I've got you now, don't I?

675
33:53.280 --> 33:56.000
That's right. He's got me now.

676
34:01.320 --> 34:02.320
What's wrong?

677
34:02.400 --> 34:03.400
Huh?

678
34:04.520 --> 34:06.160
Why did you put it out with your fingers?

679
34:15.879 --> 34:17.366
Bonus Content 3: Gu Yiliang on set

680
34:23.400 --> 34:24.480
How's filming going?

681
34:26.480 --> 34:27.480
Something came up.

682
34:28.600 --> 34:30.320
We invested in Director Lu's new show.

683
34:30.880 --> 34:32.560
It was meant to start in two weeks,

684
34:33.240 --> 34:34.920
but the male lead got caught in a scandal.

685
34:35.760 --> 34:37.880
It'll probably break in the next day or two.

686
34:38.560 --> 34:39.800
Director Lu and I discussed it,

687
34:39.840 --> 34:41.000
and we'd like you to fill in.

688
34:42.600 --> 34:43.640
That's too rushed.

689
34:43.800 --> 34:45.200
I haven't even read the script.

690
34:45.640 --> 34:46.640
I can't take it.

691
34:47.360 --> 34:50.480
Going straight into another production

692
34:50.960 --> 34:52.240
might affect my performance too.

693
34:52.800 --> 34:53.800
I'd like a break.

694
34:57.120 --> 34:58.160
It is rather rushed.

695
34:58.880 --> 34:59.880
And

696
35:00.320 --> 35:01.800
Wei Yanzi is in it too.

697
35:02.600 --> 35:03.960
If you join,

698
35:04.240 --> 35:06.720
it could spark unnecessary fan wars.

699
35:10.040 --> 35:11.400
You mean "Lan Jue?"

700
35:24.040 --> 35:25.160
Actually,

701
35:26.160 --> 35:27.680
a week to learn the lines

702
35:28.040 --> 35:29.440
and a week to find the character...

703
35:29.480 --> 35:30.560
The timing's perfect.

704
35:31.720 --> 35:34.040
And I think I'm in pretty good form.

705
35:34.120 --> 35:35.120
Don't you?

706
35:38.000 --> 35:40.480
So your sudden change of heart

707
35:40.880 --> 35:42.320
is because of Wei Yanzi?

708
35:45.480 --> 35:47.520
So you invested in this show

709
35:47.880 --> 35:49.600
because Mr. Zhu's playing the villain?

710
35:51.280 --> 35:52.480
Who's Mr. Zhu?

711
35:52.960 --> 35:53.960
I don't know him.

712
35:54.720 --> 35:55.960
I'm just in it for the money.

713
35:58.240 --> 36:00.120
I do know Wei Yanzi,

714
36:01.280 --> 36:02.440
but my only reason

715
36:02.720 --> 36:03.840
is my love of work.
